670 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (A last word though. In partial defence of New Culture intellectuals: They were born to a nation plagued by internal schisms, backwardness, and semi-colonialism. They had not seen Western ideas and structures fail like we have, with the benefit of hindsight, and they certainly are not should not be considered the antagonists here. )
/E (A last word though. In partial defence of New Culture intellectuals: They were born to a nation plagued by internal schisms, backwardness, and semi-colonialism. They had not seen Western ideas and structures fail like we have, with the benefit of hindsight, and they certainly are not should not be considered the antagonists here. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [14]
>>
