/T (In summary, the main takeaway from this section is the idea that consent is given by the citizens to the government in ways of using public resources and claiming citizenship status. After discussing the critics of the social contract, it is clear that tax would not count as theft because of legal property rights and consent which is given by citizenship and the use of public resources.)
