997 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (In this article, I will explore the role of telegrams in influencing public opinion re Russian kill claims and tactics in the ongoing Russia Ukraine war. Historically, there is great precedent for overclaiming kills, highlighted by the use of exaggerated media in this war. In 2019, the Ukrainian people were introduced to the power of social media when the former comedian and actor Volodymr Zelenskyy campaigned to be president and won by a landslide. Over the past 11 months of the Russia-Ukraine war, both sides have tried various media-shaping techniques and narratives to be pushed both to the domestic and international public.  However, one Russian social media platform has stood out above all others, namely, Telegram. Telegram, made in 2013 is similar to Whatsapp in that super-groups of up to millions of people can be created. )
/E (In this article, I will explore the role of telegrams in influencing public opinion re Russian kill claims and tactics in the ongoing Russia Ukraine war. Historically, there is great precedent for overclaiming kills, highlighted by the use of exaggerated media in this war. In 2019, the Ukrainian people were introduced to the power of social media when the former comedian and actor Volodymr Zelenskyy campaigned to be president and won by a landslide. Over the past 11 months of the Russia-Ukraine war, both sides have tried various media-shaping techniques and narratives to be pushed both to the domestic and international public.  However, one Russian social media platform has stood out above all others, namely, Telegram. Telegram, made in 2013 is similar to Whatsapp in that super-groups of up to millions of people can be created. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
998 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (In early March, a video surfaced on many Telegram channels of Zelenskyy supposedly asking for his troops to surrender. It was later proved that this was a deepfake. Other than this significant event, the first statistics that many audiences were drawn to in the opening weeks of the war, were the Ukrainian aircrafts claimed to be destroyed by the Russian Ministry of Defence \(MINDEF\). On the 4th of April 2022, \(as shown in the graphic below\), the Russians claimed 125 aircrafts were destroyed. Using the figures from the World Air Forces Directory 2022, Ukraine had 131 active \(combat-capable\) aircraft in the air force, excluding trainers, but including the many obsolete Soviet-era aircraft from the mid Cold War. Moreover, during the Russian attack on )
/E (In early March, a video surfaced on many Telegram channels of Zelenskyy supposedly asking for his troops to surrender. It was later proved that this was a deepfake. Other than this significant event, the first statistics that many audiences were drawn to in the opening weeks of the war, were the Ukrainian aircrafts claimed to be destroyed by the Russian Ministry of Defence \(MINDEF\). On the 4th of April 2022, \(as shown in the graphic below\), the Russians claimed 125 aircrafts were destroyed. Using the figures from the World Air Forces Directory 2022, Ukraine had 131 active \(combat-capable\) aircraft in the air force, excluding trainers, but including the many obsolete Soviet-era aircraft from the mid Cold War. Moreover, during the Russian attack on )
/Alt ()
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
