/T (Bakhmut, 5 aircraft \(4 aeroplanes and 1 helicopter\) were claimed destroyed in one day. As of 24th February 2023, exactly a year after the initial invasion, the claimed aeroplane losses stood at 387, which is frankly comical. Typically, aircraft are not seen to be captured, or resupplied.)
/E (Bakhmut, 5 aircraft \(4 aeroplanes and 1 helicopter\) were claimed destroyed in one day. As of 24th February 2023, exactly a year after the initial invasion, the claimed aeroplane losses stood at 387, which is frankly comical. Typically, aircraft are not seen to be captured, or resupplied.)
