1022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (The pitch up allows for increased range of its missiles, however the dispersion increases dramatically, and estimates suggest that only half the rockets can land in a 100 metre diameter. There have been questions raised about the sustainability of risking such an expensive system whilst using it as indirect airborne artillery. Media releases like this show us the true state of the battlefield - specifically on how pilots need to put great effort into minimising the danger presented by anti-air threats, and puts a more human perspective on the conflict than data on a screen.)
/E (The pitch up allows for increased range of its missiles, however the dispersion increases dramatically, and estimates suggest that only half the rockets can land in a 100 metre diameter. There have been questions raised about the sustainability of risking such an expensive system whilst using it as indirect airborne artillery. Media releases like this show us the true state of the battlefield - specifically on how pilots need to put great effort into minimising the danger presented by anti-air threats, and puts a more human perspective on the conflict than data on a screen.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [10]
>>
